Chapter: WatchdogPanicProbe

 Infinite tail-recursive spin. Compiled with `--watchdog=pet`, TCO'd into
 a self-jmp post-prologue so the prologue pet fires once and never again.
 Stale-tick counter climbs, panic fires at threshold. Used by
 the watchdog panic test to end-to-end verify the tier-3 dump.

Section: Definitions
  spin : Integer -> Integer
  spin (n) = spin (n + 1)

  opening : Integer = spin 0

